 r←Test_StdForm_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;n;globalParms;MyGuiParms
⍝ Bring up a form up with just one field in the Statusbar.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←∆Failed

 CreateGlobalParms
 globalParms←⎕NS MyGuiParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.hasStatusbar←1
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.size
     parms.size←200 400
 :EndIf
 parms.posn←45 35
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 n.VersionNo.Text←1⊃#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiAdmin.Version
 ⎕DL 1
 →FailsIf 200 400≢n.∆Form.Size
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'

 r←∆OK
